ables#Doubloons\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Silver Doubloon</a></b></span></span><b>15</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Stolen_Alabaster.png/25px-Stolen_Alabaster.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Stolen_Alabaster.png 1.5x\" /></span></span> <span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove/Collectables#Stolen_Gems\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Stolen Alabaster</a></b></span></span> at <a href=\"/page/Dusty_Old_Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 1\">Upgradeable - Tier 1</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+1 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+1 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +1 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Life_Shield\" title=\"Life Shield\">Life Shield</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Life_Shield\" title=\"Life Shield\">Life Shield</a>:</b> Every time you are hit while wearing a Life Shield item there is a 10% chance you gain 15 <a href=\"/page/Temporary_hit_points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary hit points\">temporary hitpoints</a> that last for up to 1 minute.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Lesser_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Lesser False Life</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Lesser_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Lesser False Life</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer +5 maximum <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">health</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +1</a>:</b> Passive: +1 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Saving Throws.</span></span>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 2\">Upgradeable - Tier 2</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+1 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+1 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +1 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +2 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 3\">Upgradeable - Tier 3</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Lesser_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Lesser False Life</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Lesser_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Lesser False Life</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer +5 maximum <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">health</a>.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">False Life</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">False Life</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer +10 maximum <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">health</a>.</span></span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cavalry_Plate_(Level_4).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cavalry_Plate_%28Level_4%29.png/420px-Cavalry_Plate_%28Level_4%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"492\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Cavalry_Plate_%28Level_4%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>High-seas pirates plundered this richly-decorated plate mail from naval cavalry officers. Although it did not suit the pirates well, a fighter looking for better protection may benefit from it.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/page/Item:Cavalry_Plate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item:Cavalry Plate\">Cavalry Plate</a> - Full table of the Cavalry Plate line\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>15</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Stolen_Alabaster.png/25px-Stolen_Alabaster.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Stolen_Alabaster.png 1.5x\" /></span></span> <span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove/Collectables#Stolen_Gems\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Stolen Alabaster</a></b></span></span><b>30</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Stolen_Pyrite.png/25px-Stolen_Pyrite.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Stolen_Pyrite.png 1.5x\" /></span></span> <span class=\"p